<title>POLAND: KREDYT BANK 96 NET RISES TO PLN 3.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>KREDYT BANK 96 NET RISES TO PLN 3.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results December</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					  3.17 vs    0.86</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    3.20 vs    1.50</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 17.25 vs    8.46</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	27.19 vs   16.71</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					 23.21 vs   10.32</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   40.51 vs   21.36</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		151.54 vs   90.85</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     252.10 vs  174.99</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Kredyt Bank SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
